---

<Base
  title="Comunidad & Instagram Feed Oficial | The Garage Playa del Carmen"
  description="Feed en vivo extraído directamente de @thegarage.pdc. Distribuidores oficiales de Basso, eventos Clásica 7:30 XCO, nutrición Wayfar y rodadas en Playa del Carmen."
>
  <!-- Instagram Stories Highlights Row -->
  <section style="background: #0A0A0C; padding: 1.25rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #1E293B;">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 0.25rem; scrollbar-width: none; -ms-overflow-style: none;" class="stories-track">
        {stories.map((story) => (
          <button
            type="button"
            class="story-bubble"
            data-filter={story.filter}
            style="background: transparent; border: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; min-width: 72px;"
          >
            <div style={`width: 58px; height: 58px; border-radius: 50%; padding: 2.5px; background: ${story.border}; box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255,255,255,0.1); transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);`}>
              <div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 50%; background: #141418; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; border: 2px solid #0A0A0C;">
                {story.emoji}
              </div>
            </div>
            <span style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: #CBD5E1; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;">
              {story.name}
            </span>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Editorial Magazine Hero Section -->
  <section style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0A0A0C 0%, #141418 100%); color: #FFFFFF; padding: 3.5rem 0 3rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #27272A;">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2rem;">
        
        <!-- Left: Brand Identity -->
        <div style="max-width: 680px;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.65rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
            <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FFFFFF; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid #FF3B30; box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255,59,48,0.3);">
              <img src="/img/the-garage-avatar.png" alt="Avatar The Garage" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
                <strong style="font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">thegarage.pdc</strong>
                <span style="display: inline-flex; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: #0284C7; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 0.65rem; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 900;">✓</span>
              </div>
              <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: #94A3B8;">Comunidad Ciclista • Playa del Carmen, Q.R.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h1 class="title-xl" style="color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; font-weight: 900;">
            El Punto de Encuentro del Ciclismo en el Caribe.
          </h1>
          <p class="subtitle" style="color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6;">
            Rodadas sabatinas <strong>The Garage Ride</strong>, la carrera <strong>Clásica 7:30 XCO</strong>, distribución oficial de <strong>Basso Bikes</strong>, taller de alta gama y nutrición <strong>Wayfar</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Action Badge & Follow -->
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; align-items: flex-start;">
          <a
            href="https://www.instagram.com/thegarage.pdc/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn"
            style="background: linear-gradient(45deg, #F58529, #D62976, #962FBF, #4F5BD5); color: #FFFFFF; padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem; font-size: 0.92rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(214,41,118,0.35);"
          >
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Seguir @thegarage.pdc ↗</span>
          </a>
          <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #94A3B8; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;">
            <span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #22C55E;"></span>
            Sincronización en vivo con Instagram
          </span>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Interactive Feed Section -->
  <section style="padding: 3rem 0 5rem 0;">
    <div class="container">
      
      <!-- Interactive Filter Tabs -->
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 0.5rem;" id="insta-filters">
          <button type="button" class="tab-pill active" data-tipo="todas">Todo el Feed ({posts.length})</button>
          <button type="button" class="tab-pill" data-tipo="rodada">🌴 Rodadas &amp; Bikepacking</button>
          <button type="button" class="tab-pill" data-tipo="evento">🏆 Eventos &amp; Clásica 7:30</button>
          <button type="button" class="tab-pill" data-tipo="arribo">🇮🇹 Basso Bikes</button>
          <button type="button" class="tab-pill" data-tipo="taller">🔧 Taller Mecánico</button>
          <button type="button" class="tab-pill" data-tipo="lifestyle">⚡ Nutrición &amp; Kits</button>
        </div>

        <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #64748B;">
          Mostrando {posts.length} publicaciones
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Social Grid Layout with Ultra-Crisp Cards -->
      <div class="social-grid">
        {posts.map((post) => (
          <article class="social-card" data-tipo={post.tipo}>
            <!-- Card Image Box -->
            <a
              href={post.permalink}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="card-image-link"
              title="Abrir publicación original en Instagram"
            >
              <img
                src={post.imagen}
                alt={post.titulo}
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div class="card-glass-badge">
                {post.badge}
              </div>
              <div class="card-hover-overlay">
                <span class="overlay-button">
                  Ver en Instagram ↗
                </span>
              </div>
            </a>

            <!-- Card Content Box -->
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="card-meta">
                <span class="category-tag">
                  {post.emoji} {post.categoria}
                </span>
                <span class="post-source">@thegarage.pdc</span>
              </div>

              <h2 class="card-title">
                {post.titulo}
              </h2>

              <p class="card-desc">
                {post.descripcion}
              </p>

              <!-- Specs Pills -->
              <div class="specs-row">
                {post.specs.map((spec) => (
                  <span class="spec-pill">✓ {spec}</span>
                ))}
              </div>

              <!-- Footer Actions -->
              <div class="card-footer">
                <a
                  href={`https://wa.me/529841381493?text=Hola,%20vi%20la%20publicaci%C3%B3n%20sobre%20${encodeURIComponent(post.titulo)}%20(${post.permalink})%20y%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20m%C3%A1s%20informaci%C3%B3n.`}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="btn btn-whatsapp"
                  style="padding: 0.5rem 1rem; font-size: 0.82rem;"
                >
                  Consultar por WhatsApp
                </a>
                <a
                  href={post.permalink}
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="post-link"
                >
                  Abrir Post ↗
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>

      <!-- Riders Club Premium Callout -->
      <div class="club-banner">
        <div style="max-width: 780px; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
          <div class="club-badge">
            🚴 THE GARAGE RIDERS CLUB
          </div>
          <h2 class="title-lg" style="color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
            Únete a la familia The Garage en Playa del Carmen
          </h2>
          <p style="color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6;">
            Salidas grupales todos los fines de semana, entrenamientos para la Clásica 7:30 XCO, soporte de mecánicos y descuentos exclusivos en nutrición Wayfar:
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="club-grid">
          <div class="club-card">
            <div class="club-icon">🌴</div>
            <strong>The Garage Ride</strong>
            <p>Rodadas sabatinas hacia Cenotes, Tulum y Puerto Aventuras con vehículo barredora.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="club-card">
            <div class="club-icon">🏆</div>
            <strong>Clásica 7:30 XCO</strong>
            <p>Inscripciones preferenciales y entrenamientos en el circuito técnico de cross-country.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="club-card">
            <div class="club-icon">⚡</div>
            <strong>Descuento en Wayfar &amp; SRAM</strong>
            <p>Electrolitos, geles, refacciones originales y upgrades especializados en taller.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="club-card">
            <div class="club-icon">🔧</div>
            <strong>1er Mantenimiento Gratis</strong>
            <p>Reajuste de chicotes, tensión de cadena y tornillería a los 30 días de rodar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; align-items: center;">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/529841381493?text=Hola,%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20unirme%20a%20The%20Garage%20Ride%20y%20conocer%20las%20pr%C3%B3ximas%20fechas%20de%20rodadas."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn btn-whatsapp btn-lg"
            style="padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem; font-size: 0.95rem;"
          >
            Unirme al Grupo de Rodadas en WhatsApp
          </a>
          <a
            href="/"
            class="btn"
            style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #0A0A0C; padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800;"
          >
            Ver Catálogo de Bicicletas →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .story-bubble:hover div {
    transform: scale(1.08);
  }

  .tab-pill {
    padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    background: #FFFFFF;
    color: #334155;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  .tab-pill:hover {
    border-color: #0F172A;
    background: #F8FAFC;
  }
  .tab-pill.active {
    background: #0F172A;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: #0F172A;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.2);
  }

  .social-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .social-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
